{
  "title": "Dua of Exaltation",
  "data": "In his book Miqbas al-Masabih, 'Allamah al-Majlisi says: Imam al-Sadiq (a) is reported through valid chains of authority to have said: there are three hours at night and three others at day at which Allah, the Almighty and Majestic, glorifies Himself. The three hours of the day begin when the sun on the east side rises to the same height it later reaches on the west side in the afternoon — that is, at early forenoon. The three hours of night begin at the last third of the night up to dawn (fajr). Any servant who glorifies Allah, the Almighty and Majestic, at these hours with full heart-presence, Almighty Allah will settle his needs, and if he is unhappy (because of sinning), I expect that he will be made happy.\nIt is most suitable to say the following words of glorification at these hours:\nاَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ رَبُّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ اَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ الرَّحْمٰنُ الرَّحِيْمُ اَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ الْعَلِىُّ الْكَبِيْرُ اَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ مَلِكُ يَوْمِ الدِّيْنِ\nANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTA RABBUL A'AALAMEEN, ANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTAR RAHMAANUR RAHEEM, ANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTAL A'LIYYUL KABEER, ANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTA MALIKU YAWMID DEEN\nYou are Allah, there is no god except You, Lord of the worlds. You are Allah, there is no god except You, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful. You are Allah, there is no god except You, the Most High, the Great. You are Allah, there is no god except You, Master of the Day of Judgment.\nاَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ الْغَفُوْرُ الرَّحِيْمُ اَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ الْعَزِيْزُ الْحَكِيْمُ اَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ مِنْكَ بَدْءُ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ وَاِلَيْكَ يَعُوْدُ كُلُّ شَيْءٍ\nANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTAL GHAFOORUR RAHEEM, ANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTAL A'ZEEZUL HAKEEM, ANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTA MINKA BAD-U KULLI SHAY-IN WA ILAYKA YA-O'ODU KULLU SHAY\nYou are Allah, there is no god except You, the All-forgiving, the All-merciful. You are Allah, there is no god except You, the All-mighty, the All-wise. You are Allah, there is no god except You; from You is the origin of all things, and to You returns all things.\nاَنْتَ اللّٰهُ الَّذِىْ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ لَمْ تَزَلْ وَلَا تَزَالُ اَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ خَالِقُ الْخَيْرِ وَالشَّرِّ اَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ خَالِقُ الْجَنَّةِ وَالنَّارِ\nANTALLAAHUL LAZEE LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTA LAM TAZAL WA LAA TAZAAL, ANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTA KHAALIQUL KHAYRI WASH SHARR, ANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTA KHAALIQUL JANNATI WAN NAAR\nYou are Allah, besides Whom there is no god; You have never ceased to be and You never shall cease. You are Allah, there is no god except You, Creator of good and evil. You are Allah, there is no god except You, Creator of Paradise and Hellfire.\nاَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ الْاَحَدُ الصَّمَدُ لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُوْلَدْ وَلَمْ يَكُنْ لَّهٗ كُفُوًا اَحَدٌ اَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ الْمَلِكُ الْقُدُّوْسُ السَّلَامُ الْمُؤْمِنُ الْمُهَيْمِنُ الْعَزِيْزُ الْجَبَّارُ الْمُتَكَبِّرُ سُبْحَانَ اللّٰهِ عَمَّا يُشْرِكُوْنَ\nANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTAL AHADUS SAMAD, LAM YALID WA LAM YOOLAD WA LAM YAKUL LAHU KUFUWAN AHAD, ANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTAL MALIKUL QUDDOOSUS SALAAMUL MU-MINUL MUHAYMINUL A'ZEEZUL JABBAARUL MUTAKABBIR, SUBHAANALLAAHI A'MMAA YUSHRIKOON\nYou are Allah, there is no god except You, the One, the Everlasting Refuge, Who begets not nor is begotten, and there is none equal to Him. You are Allah, there is no god except You, the Sovereign, the Holy, the Source of Peace, the Granter of Security, the Guardian, the Almighty, the Compeller, the Supreme in Greatness; Glory be to Allah above what they associate with Him.\nاَنْتَ اللّٰهُ الْخَالِقُ الْبَارِئُ الْمُصَوِّرُ لَكَ الْاَسْمَاۤءُ الْحُسْنٰى يُسَبِّحُ لَكَ مَا فِىْ السَّمٰوَاتِ وَالْاَرْضِ وَاَنْتَ الْعَزِيْزُ الْحَكِيْمُ اَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ الْكَبِيْرُ الْمُتَعَالِ وَالْكِبْرِيَاۤءُ رِدَاۤؤُكَ\nANTALLAAHUL KHAALIQUL BAARI-U'L MUSAWWIR, LAKAL ASMAAA-UL HUSNAA, YUSABBIHU LAKA MAA FIS SAMAAWAATI WAL ARD, WA ANTAL A'ZEEZUL HAKEEM, ANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANTAL KABEERUL MUTA-A'AL WAL KIBRIYAAA-U RIDAAA-UK\nYou are Allah, the Creator, the Originator, the Fashioner; to You belong the Most Excellent Names; whatever is in the heavens and the earth glorifies You, and You are the All-mighty, the All-wise. You are Allah, there is no god except You, the Great, the Most Exalted, and greatness is Your garment."
}
